@MinimalKafka.Dashboard_HostAddress = http://localhost:5242
@MinimalKafka.Dashboard_RoutePrefix = /kafka-dashboard

### Dashboard UI
GET {{MinimalKafka.Dashboard_HostAddress}}{{MinimalKafka.Dashboard_RoutePrefix}}/

### Consumer status
GET {{MinimalKafka.Dashboard_HostAddress}}{{MinimalKafka.Dashboard_RoutePrefix}}/api/consumer/status

### Start consumers
POST {{MinimalKafka.Dashboard_HostAddress}}{{MinimalKafka.Dashboard_RoutePrefix}}/api/consumer/start

### Stop consumers
POST {{MinimalKafka.Dashboard_HostAddress}}{{MinimalKafka.Dashboard_RoutePrefix}}/api/consumer/stop

### Consumer group members
GET {{MinimalKafka.Dashboard_HostAddress}}{{MinimalKafka.Dashboard_RoutePrefix}}/api/consumer-group/members

### Consumer group offsets
GET {{MinimalKafka.Dashboard_HostAddress}}{{MinimalKafka.Dashboard_RoutePrefix}}/api/consumer-group/offsets

### Reset consumer group offsets
POST {{MinimalKafka.Dashboard_HostAddress}}{{MinimalKafka.Dashboard_RoutePrefix}}/api/consumer-group/offsets/reset
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "offsets": [
    {
      "topic": "example-topic",
      "partition": 0,
      "offset": 0
    }
  ]
}

### Topic messages
GET {{MinimalKafka.Dashboard_HostAddress}}{{MinimalKafka.Dashboard_RoutePrefix}}/api/topics/messages?topic=example-topic&count=10

